        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOUIn_wMK0IkRgNe5RgRcn8QT0tedPnbG7bHm2POnHTAVCNAuvlw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "If you looking for the best laser hair removal machine and person, Cristina is the one ! After one full session, I can see the results. I’m so impressed. I have, honestly, 60% less hair with one treatment ! 🫶🫶\n\nI found Cristina, throughout a friend, last year. She is absolutely amazing and the job she’s doing is phenomenal! You can see the difference from the 1st session.\nSince December 2024 when I went to see her for the 1st time, I did a face full treatment, a peeling and I’m doing the laser hear removal. Like I said, for all this treatments, i could see the difference from the beginning and my friends too.\n\nI recommend her 1000% !!!\n\nTry it once, you’ll not regret it and I guarantee you, you’ll visited her over and over again 😁.\n\nCristina, I love you 😘!\nYou’re the best !\n\nThank God I met you 🫶🫶🫶",
        "time": 1739034032,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
