      {
        "author_name": "leila setoodeh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100434625634269478201/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIfC-SW2toFSvJgprCYATwPnaT4YX7DWreh44VyUyRbtWKLFQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Cristina is very passionate about her work and she s a very good specialist for Diode laser machine. I recommend her without any doubt.\nIt is my 2nd session of complete epilation and I can see the results immediately. I have no pain during the process and my skin feels soft and smooth. I've done facials and peeling with her and I am very satisfied",
        "time": 1701817308,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Valentina Ursu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110002331644271283990/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLjUAu-b0t3JGVSd_9j1y2oLHUk6VFigMPEmSvEbjO2fxRMgA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Cristina not only offers a variety of high-quality services such as certified massotherapy but also delivers personalized care tailored to individual skincare needs.  I had the pleasure of experiencing a rejuvenating session with Cristina, where I was introduced to the incredible hydrafacial machine. The hydrafacial treatment left my skin glowing instantly, and I could feel the difference right away. The attention to detail and dedication to excellence were evident throughout the session. I had a fantastic experience as the tranquil ambiance created a perfect atmosphere for relaxation. It was an absolute pleasure, and I look forward to my next session. Highly recommended!",
